    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>it's just not that helpful though. i mean i know people say that, but therapy feels like just another way to try and force me to fit into a world that doesn't want me. even a therapist is just gonna try to fix me so i can be 'normal' again. but there's nothing to fix, i just... i'm just fundamentally wrong. it feels like i'm fighting a war every single day just to exist, and i'm so tired of losing. it feels like the more i try, the further away everything gets.",
