      "content": "it just feels like a losing game. no matter how much i respect myself or try to be \"authentic,\" i'm still just stuck in this loop of being exhausted. like, what's the point of fighting so hard for a life that's just constant friction? sometimes i look at the silence and the nothingness and it actually sounds more peaceful than any version of \"existing\" i can imagine. it feels like the only way to actually stop the noise is to just stop.",
